{"channelId":"UCj_g3TZCVGxe9ulchIh5wYw","row":["Atrin and Soren with Nikan",361000,"Fun and Educational Videos for Toddlers and Kids | Farm Animals, Wild Animals & Dinosaur Adventures! Welcome to Atrin and Soren with Nikan's Channel, your go-to spot for fun educational videos for toddlers and kids! Dive into exciting adventures featuring farm animals, wild animals, and dinosaurs—designed to make learning fun and engaging for young children. Our videos combine entertainment and education, sparking curiosity and wonder as kids discover fascinating facts about animals and dinosaurs.\n\nJoin Atrin, Soren, and Nikan, three adventurous siblings, as they explore the world of animals and prehistoric creatures. Whether at the zoo, a museum, or from home, your kids will learn about animals, develop empathy, and understand the importance of kindness and diversity.\n\nThis channel supports developmental milestones, encouraging learning through play and exploration. Subscribe now for a fun-filled, educational adventure with Atrin, Soren, and Nikan!","","United States"],"channelUrl":"https://www.youtube.com/channel/UCj_g3TZCVGxe9ulchIh5wYw","biographySource":{"sourceUrl":"https://www.youtube.com/channel/UCj_g3TZCVGxe9ulchIh5wYw","observedAt":"2026-09-18T12:20:21.202Z","channelId":"UCj_g3TZCVGxe9ulchIh5wYw","sourceType":"about","contentHash":"3612a1a1df82a3364c9a2c97a44eea9723620932cbe610bac37b46dc06aa2162","complete":true,"readStatus":"read","captureSha256":"aee7a3ede2f142c22835a2072205f0f6516e305c56d46aeb8cc246d3904dd52e"},"countrySource":{"sourceUrl":"https://www.youtube.com/channel/UCj_g3TZCVGxe9ulchIh5wYw","observedAt":"2026-09-18T12:20:21.202Z"},"followerAccounts":[{"platform":"youtube","url":"https://www.youtube.com/channel/UCj_g3TZCVGxe9ulchIh5wYw","identityStatus":"channel_published","value":361000,"raw":"361K subscribers","precision":"rounded","sourceUrl":"https://www.youtube.com/channel/UCj_g3TZCVGxe9ulchIh5wYw","observedAt":"2026-09-18T12:20:21.202Z"}],"emails":[],"con